{"step_index":275,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-10T13:00:48Z","input_tokens":10442,"cache_read_tokens":203852,"output_tokens":15238,"thinking":"Preparing to integrate the complete Universal Iteration & All-Steps Dry-Run Explorer into the `app.js` file. The goal is to enhance the application's debugging and execution analysis capabilities. This update will enable comprehensive exploration of the code's behavior during iterations.\n\n\nThe primary focus is ensuring the function `buildIterationGroups(steps)` can handle diverse code structures. This involves designing specific grouping strategies for loop-based DSA, OOP/method-call code, and recursive code. Considering the need for clear visual representation, maintaining the context of nested calls within their respective operations is crucial using root action line tracking.\n\n\nFocus is now on designing the `buildIterationGroups` function to handle recursive code execution steps, specifically identifying call frames and return points. A system for associating each step with its corresponding call frame's execution context is under development. Root action line tracking will maintain this association, enabling correct grouping of nested recursive calls.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"\"// app_build/app.js — Thonny-Style Visual Execution, Memory Model & Universal DSA Iteration Explorer\\n// Preserves the rule-based engine (engine.js) and teacher (explainer.js) while adding:\\n// 1. Visual Reference Model (Name -> @Address -> Value Stack & Heap Memory Panel)\\n// 2. Step-by-Step Sub-Expression Evaluator (F7 micro-stepper + short-circuit indicator)\\n// 3. Global vs. Local Variable Scope Isolation UI\\n// 4. Visual Garbage Collection (filtering / dimming unreferenced heap objects)\\n// 5. Complete Code Iteration & All-Steps Dry-Run Explorer (works for any Loop, OOP, or Recursive code)\\n\\nclass TeachMeCodeApp {\\n  constructor() {\\n    this.engine = new window.PythonExecutionEngine();\\n    this.explainer = new window.RuleBasedExplainer();\\n\\n    this.currentPresetKey = \\\"stack_class\\\";\\n    const defaultProg =\\n      window.PRELOADED_PROGRAMS[this.currentPresetKey] ||\\n      window.PRELOADED_PROGRAMS[\\\"max_subarray\\\"];\\n    this.sourceCode = defaultProg.code;\\n    this.inputCode = defaultProg.defaultInput || \\\"\\\";\\n\\n    this.traceResult = null;\\n    this.iterationGroups = [];\\n    this.stepToGroupIdx = new Map();\\n    this.collapsedGroupIds = new Set();\\n    this.allGroupsCollapsed = false;\\n    this.iterationsViewMode = \\\"grouped\\\"; // \\\"grouped\\\" | \\\"table\\\"\\n    this.showIterationsPanel = true;\\n\\n    this.currentStepIdx = 0;\\n    this.currentSubStepIdx = 0;\\n    this.showGCObjects = false;\\n\\n    this.isPlaying = false;\\n    this.playInterval = null;\\n    this.playSpeedMs = 1200;\\n    this.isEditing = false;\\n    this.showAdvanced = false;\\n\\n    this.initDOM();\\n    this.bindEvents();\\n    this.codeTextarea.value = this.sourceCode;\\n    this.inputPlaygroundField.value = this.inputCode;\\n    this.analyzeAndRun();\\n  }\\n\\n  initDOM() {\\n    // Simple Navigation Controls\\n    this.stepProgressLabel = document.getElementById(\\\"stepProgressLabel\\\");\\n    this.activeScopeBadge = document.getElementById(\\\"activeScopeBadge\\\");\\n    this.btnPrev = document.getElementById(\\\"btnPrev\\\");\\n    this.btnSubStep\n<truncated 49933 bytes>","Description":"\"Upgrade app_build/app.js with Universal Iteration & All-Steps Dry-Run Explorer (Iteration Jump Strip, Grouped Iteration Cards, and All-Steps Dry-Run Table)\"","Overwrite":"true","TargetFile":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\CVT\\\\.gemini\\\\antigravity\\\\scratch\\\\code-flow-visualizer\\\\app_build\\\\app.js\"","toolAction":"\"Upgrading app_build/app.js with Iteration & All-Steps Dry-Run Explorer\"","toolSummary":"\"Upgrade app_build/app.js with Iteration Explorer\""}}],"truncated_fields":[